{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-27T07:33:18.592Z","data":{"text":"Done. Summary:\n\n- Implemented `orderDispatchItems` in `src/core/status/dispatch-order.ts`: computes each item's weight (1 + active changes in any tree whose `depends_on` transitively reaches it, cycles counted once) and reason (`watcher idle; this gives it work`, `holds up N change(s)`, or `in change order`), then sorts by idle-work group, weight desc, change id asc, change-level before tasks, task number asc.\n- Added `tests/dispatch-order.test.ts` covering all four delta scenarios plus a cross-tree (stacked) weight case and deterministic re-ordering.\n- `node --import tsx --test tests/dispatch-order.test.ts`: 5/5 pass.\n- `pnpm verify`: typechecks, build, 88 tests, and lint all pass.\n- Wrote `openspec/changes/097-inbox-dispatch-order/.run/results/2.md`.\n\nTouched: `src/core/status/dispatch-order.ts`, `tests/dispatch-order.test.ts`, `openspec/changes/097-inbox-dispatch-order/.run/results/2.md`."}}
